            "question": "How do preorders work?",
            "answer": "<p>Preorder items ship as soon as they arrive in our warehouse. Each product page lists the expected ship date. Your card is charged when you place the order. If your order includes in-stock items and preorders, we ship in-stock items right away.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4grWep": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We don't accept returns, but if a game isn't right for you, we'll still refund it. Donate the game to a local library, school, or play space, then send us the donation receipt within 30 days of delivery. We'll refund the cost of the game once it's confirmed. Shipping costs are not refunded.</p>"
          }
        },
